              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12 mt-2 mb-12" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-01-shape-of-all-work" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(1)" data-infographic-source="infographic.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i1-section-01-shape-of-all-work</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-brand-border border-l-8 border-l-brand-primary">
<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">The Shape of All Work</h2>
<p class="text-brand-muted max-w-4xl leading-relaxed">
                    Every productive process follows the same loop at every scale:
                    <span class="font-mono text-brand-strong">P(Zn) = Z(n+1)</span>.
                    The state changes; the process itself can also evolve.
                </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mt-8">
<div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4">
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl bg-brand-light p-4">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">Scale of Iteration</div>
<div class="space-y-1">
<button aria-pressed="false" class="shape-scale-btn w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-brand-muted" data-shape-scale="0" type="button">
<span class="font-semibold">Keystroke</span>
<span class="float-right text-xs font-mono opacity-70">~100ms</span>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="shape-scale-btn w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-brand-muted" data-shape-scale="1" type="button">
<span class="font-semibold">Function</span>
<span class="float-right text-xs font-mono opacity-70">~minutes</span>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="true" class="shape-scale-btn w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-brand-muted" data-shape-scale="2" type="button">
<span class="font-semibold">Feature</span>
<span class="float-right text-xs font-mono opacity-70">~days</span>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="shape-scale-btn w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-brand-muted" data-shape-scale="3" type="button">
<span class="font-semibold">Product</span>
<span class="float-right text-xs font-mono opacity-70">~months</span>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="shape-scale-btn w-full text-left px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-brand-muted" data-shape-scale="4" type="button">
<span class="font-semibold">Company</span>
<span class="float-right text-xs font-mono opacity-70">~years</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl bg-brand-light p-4 transition-colors duration-200" id="shapeSdacCard">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted uppercase tracking-wide">SDaC Protocol</div>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="relative inline-flex w-12 h-6 rounded-full border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface transition-colors duration-200" id="shapeSdacToggle" type="button">
<span class="absolute top-0.5 left-0.5 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform duration-200" id="shapeSdacKnob"></span>
</button>
</div>
<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed" id="shapeSdacDescription">
                                Standard mode: acceleration without structure. Faster loops can also accelerate drift.
                            </p>
<div class="mt-3 hidden flex-wrap gap-2" id="shapeSdacBadges">
<span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded border border-[rgba(187,154,247,0.4)] text-brand-accent bg-[rgba(187,154,247,0.12)]">Validation</span>
<span class="text-[10px] px-2 py-1 rounded border border-[rgba(187,154,247,0.4)] text-brand-accent bg-[rgba(187,154,247,0.12)]">Bounded Effectors</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4">
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl bg-brand-light p-4">
<div class="font-mono text-sm md:text-base">
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-brand-muted">
<span>Iteration:</span>
<span class="text-brand-strong"><span class="text-brand-accent">P</span>(Zn) = <span class="text-brand-vibrant">Z(n+1)</span></span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 mt-2 text-xs md:text-sm text-brand-muted">
<span>Evolution:</span>
<span><span class="text-brand-accent">Pk</span> → <span class="text-brand-accent">P(k+1)</span></span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="relative h-80 md:h-96 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.75)] overflow-hidden" id="shapeVisualizer">
<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-25 shape-visualizer-grid"></div>
<div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-64 h-64 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border border-dashed border-brand-border" id="shapeOrbitRing"></div>
<div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-[132px] w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_14px_rgba(255,255,255,0.55)]"></div>
<div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-[158px] text-[10px] font-mono text-brand-muted">Z(n) Input</div>
<div class="hidden absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 w-72 h-72 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border-2 border-[rgba(187,154,247,0.35)]" id="shapeGuardRing"></div>
<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" id="shapeParticles"></div>
<div class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-44 h-44 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-border bg-brand-surface flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center px-4">
<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-muted">Process</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-brand-accent" id="shapeProcessLabel">Team + Practices</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute top-4 right-4">
<div class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface text-brand-muted" id="shapeLoopModeBadge">STANDARD LOOP</div>
</div>
<div class="hidden absolute top-1/2 right-4 md:right-8 -translate-y-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-1" id="shapeGuardStatus">
<div class="text-brand-vibrant text-base">🛡</div>
<div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase text-brand-vibrant">Validated</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">
<span>⏱ </span><span id="shapeTimeLabel">~days</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
<div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-light">
<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-muted">Current State (Zn)</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-lg text-brand-strong font-semibold" id="shapeStateLabel">Codebase</div>
</div>
<div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-light">
<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-muted">The Process (P)</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-lg text-brand-accent font-semibold" id="shapeProcessCardLabel">Team + Practices</div>
</div>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed" id="shapeScaleDescription"></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-8 border border-brand-border rounded-xl bg-brand-light p-4">
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 border-b border-brand-border pb-3">
<button aria-selected="true" class="shape-tab-btn is-active text-sm font-semibold pb-1" data-shape-tab="concept" type="button">The Fractal Shape</button>
<button aria-selected="false" class="shape-tab-btn text-sm font-semibold pb-1" data-shape-tab="recursive" type="button">Recursive Improvement</button>
<button aria-selected="false" class="shape-tab-btn text-sm font-semibold pb-1" data-shape-tab="sdac" type="button">Why SDaC?</button>
</div>
<div class="mt-4">
<div data-shape-panel="concept">
<p class="text-brand-strong text-lg font-semibold mb-2">The structure is identical at every scale.</p>
<p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                                Whether you type one character or steer a company, you still transform a current state into a next state through a process. What changes is the time constant and impact radius.
                            </p>
</div>
<div class="hidden" data-shape-panel="recursive">
<p class="text-brand-strong text-lg font-semibold mb-2">The process itself is part of the loop.</p>
<div class="rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface p-3 font-mono text-sm text-brand-muted">
<div><span class="text-brand-accent">next_state</span> = process(current_state)</div>
<div class="mt-1"><span class="text-brand-vibrant">process</span> = improve(process, evidence)</div>
</div>
<p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed mt-3">
                                Real systems are recursive: execution generates evidence, and evidence upgrades the process that executes.
                            </p>
</div>
<div class="hidden" data-shape-panel="sdac">
<p class="text-brand-strong text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Acceleration without structure is chaos.</p>
<p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                                AI raises loop speed. SDaC adds deterministic validation, bounded effectors, and explicit intent so higher velocity converges instead of drifting.
                            </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-3">
<div class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-[rgba(247,118,142,0.35)] bg-[rgba(247,118,142,0.08)]">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-danger">Standard loop</div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Trust the model; mistakes scale with speed.</div>
</div>
<div class="p-3 rounded-xl border border-[rgba(42,195,222,0.35)] bg-[rgba(42,195,222,0.10)]">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-vibrant">SDaC loop</div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Trust the loop; validators enforce convergence.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-02-mission-object-loop" aria-label="Mission Object &amp; The Loop" data-slide-index="1" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">Mission Object &amp; The Loop</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i1-section-02-mission-object-loop</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-02-mission-object-loop" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(2)" data-infographic-source="infographic.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i1-section-02-mission-object-loop</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-brand-border flex flex-col gap-6">
<!-- Featured Sandwich Diagram -->
<div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">Mission Object &amp; The Loop</h3>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-5">
<figure class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface">
<img alt="The Loop as a Quality Refinery: Generation → Validation → Refinement around a deterministic Mission Object, with failed attempts fed back and trusted output exiting the loop." class="w-full h-auto block select-none" src="diagrams/2026-02-12-deterministic-sandwich-dark.png"/>
</figure>
<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                            This panel shows the Mission Object loop: probabilistic generation enters, validation filters, refinement feeds failures back with error context, and only trusted output exits.
                        </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Deterministic Sandwich -->
<div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">Deterministic Sandwich</h3>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-5">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 items-start">
<div class="lg:col-span-7">
<div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface">
<img alt="The Deterministic Sandwich: Prep/Mission Object → Model/GenAI → Validation/Gate" class="w-full h-auto block select-none" src="diagrams/deterministic-sandwich.png"/>
<div class="absolute rounded-xl border-2 border-brand-vibrant pointer-events-none transition-all duration-150" id="sandwichHighlight" style="left: 24%; top: 42%; width: 52%; height: 14%;"></div>
<button aria-label="Prep / Mission Object" class="absolute rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/60 hover:ring-2 hover:ring-brand-primary/40" data-sandwich="prep" style="left: 16%; top: 18%; width: 68%; height: 16%;" type="button"></button>
<button aria-label="Model / GenAI" class="absolute rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/60 hover:ring-2 hover:ring-brand-primary/40" data-sandwich="model" style="left: 24%; top: 42%; width: 52%; height: 14%;" type="button"></button>
<button aria-label="Validation / Gate" class="absolute rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/60 hover:ring-2 hover:ring-brand-primary/40" data-sandwich="validation" style="left: 20%; top: 62%; width: 60%; height: 22%;" type="button"></button>
</div>
<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
<button aria-pressed="false" class="sandwich-select inline-flex items-center px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface text-brand-strong text-sm font-semibold hover:border-[rgba(122,162,247,0.6)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/60" data-sandwich="prep" type="button">
                                        Prep
                                    </button>
<button aria-pressed="true" class="sandwich-select inline-flex items-center px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface text-brand-strong text-sm font-semibold hover:border-[rgba(122,162,247,0.6)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/60" data-sandwich="model" type="button">
                                        Model
                                    </button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="sandwich-select inline-flex items-center px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface text-brand-strong text-sm font-semibold hover:border-[rgba(122,162,247,0.6)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/60" data-sandwich="validation" type="button">
                                        Validation
                                    </button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5">
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl bg-brand-surface p-4">
<div class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-strong" id="sandwichTitle">Model / GenAI</div>
<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed" id="sandwichBody">
                                        One bounded stochastic step. Output is untrusted until it passes Validation.
                                    </p>
<div class="mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-brand-border">
<div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-brand-muted uppercase tracking-wide">Operational Notes</div>
<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed" id="sandwichDetail">
                                            The model explores candidates inside a bounded mission packet; no side effects happen at this layer.
                                        </p>
<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-xs text-brand-muted list-disc list-inside">
<li id="sandwichPoint1">Draft outputs are proposals, not accepted state.</li>
<li id="sandwichPoint2">Cost scales by candidate count, while acceptance is controlled by the gate.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3 text-sm text-brand-muted">
                                    Only the middle is stochastic. The bread is deterministic, so drift becomes safe to integrate.
                                </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Substrate Surfaces -->
<div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">Substrate - Safe autonomy starts when intent and reality are explicit, and every change is traceable.</h3>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border border-l-4 border-l-brand-primary rounded-xl p-5">
<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2">
<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong">Map</h3>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Intent surface</div>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                                A structured, machine-readable representation of reality: docs, contracts, inventories, derived views.
                            </p>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border border-l-4 border-l-brand-vibrant rounded-xl p-5">
<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2">
<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong">Terrain</h3>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Runnable reality</div>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                                Reality-as-code: source, configs, schemas, and the behavior your systems actually execute.
                            </p>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border border-l-4 border-l-brand-accent rounded-xl p-5">
<div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-2">
<h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong">Ledger</h3>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Evidence trail</div>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                                Append-only history of diffs and receipts: validator output, decision traces, and provenance.
                            </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Rule of Seven -->
<div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">Rule of Seven</h3>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-5">
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4 bg-brand-surface">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-3">
<div>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Layering Heuristic</div>
<div class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                                            Aim for ~7 (±2) siblings per layer. Too many becomes a junk drawer; too few becomes a rabbit hole.
                                        </div>
</div>
<div class="sm:text-right">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Siblings per layer</div>
<div class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-strong"><span id="ruleSevenValue">5</span>/9</div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<input aria-label="Rule of Seven sibling slider" class="w-full" id="ruleSevenSlider" max="9" min="1" step="1" type="range" value="5"/>
<div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-9 items-center text-[11px] font-mono text-brand-muted">
<span class="col-start-1 justify-self-start">1</span>
<span class="col-start-5 justify-self-center text-brand-strong">5 (Target)</span>
<span class="col-start-7 justify-self-center">7</span>
<span class="col-start-9 justify-self-end">9</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-1 flex justify-between text-[11px] text-brand-muted">
<span>Rabbit-hole edge</span>
<span>Junk-drawer edge</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-3">
<div class="lg:col-span-4 border border-brand-border rounded-lg p-3 bg-brand-light">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Tree Profile</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-sm font-bold text-brand-strong" id="ruleSevenModeTitle">Balanced spread</div>
<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed" id="ruleSevenModeBody"></p>
<div class="mt-3 text-xs text-brand-muted font-mono" id="ruleSevenStats"></div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-8 border border-brand-border rounded-lg p-3 bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)]">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Example project tree</div>
