</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-03-inference-cost-paradox" aria-label="The Inference Cost Paradox" data-slide-index="2" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">The Inference Cost Paradox</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i1-section-03-inference-cost-paradox</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12 mb-8" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-03-inference-cost-paradox" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(3)" data-infographic-source="infographic.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i1-section-03-inference-cost-paradox</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-brand-border border-l-8 border-l-brand-vibrant">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
<div class="md:w-1/2">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-4">The Inference Cost Paradox (Looped Systems)</h2>
<p class="text-lg text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
	                            Per-call inference cost may fall. But in production, inference becomes structural: it is embedded inside autonomous loops.
	                            <br/><br/>
<span class="text-brand-strong font-semibold">Inference is no longer a utility. It is infrastructure.</span>
	                            Infrastructure is hedged.
	                        </p>
<div class="mt-5 bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong mb-2">When inference becomes structural</div>
<ul class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
<li>Pricing volatility → operational risk</li>
<li>Provider lock-in → systemic dependency</li>
<li>Latency → architectural friction</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="mt-4 bg-brand-light p-4 rounded text-brand-strong font-semibold border-l-4 border-l-brand-accent">
	                            When recursion drives production, compute becomes the power grid.
	                        </div>
<div class="mt-4 text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
	                            Use the Hedge Builder to see how cost and risk change as autonomy rises, and how different hedges trade flexibility for certainty.
	                        </div>
</div>
<div class="md:w-1/2">
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4" id="hedgeBuilderCard">
<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
<div>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Hedge Builder</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong">Compute exposure scales with autonomy</div>
</div>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">
	                                    Autonomy <span class="text-brand-strong" id="hedgeAutonomyValue">60%</span>
</div>
</div>
<label class="sr-only" for="hedgeAutonomySlider">Autonomy slider</label>
<input class="mt-3 w-full" id="hedgeAutonomySlider" max="100" min="0" type="range" value="60"/>
<div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
<button aria-pressed="false" class="hedge-toggle" data-hedge-key="fixed" type="button">Fixed-cost contracts</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="hedge-toggle" data-hedge-key="reserve" type="button">Capacity reservations</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="hedge-toggle" data-hedge-key="multi" type="button">Multi-provider routing</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="hedge-toggle" data-hedge-key="hybrid" type="button">Hybrid / owned compute</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="hedge-toggle sm:col-span-2" data-hedge-key="minFrontier" type="button">Minimize irreducible frontier calls</button>
</div>
<div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Expected cost / outcome</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong"><span id="hedgeExpectedCost">—</span></div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Index (lower is better)</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">P95 cost / outcome</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-brand-danger"><span id="hedgeP95Cost">—</span></div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">
	                                        Tail premium: +<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong" id="hedgeTailPremium">—</span>
<span class="ml-2">(<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong" id="hedgeP95Delta">—</span> vs spot)</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Cost certainty</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong"><span id="hedgeCertainty">—</span>%</div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Inverse of pricing volatility</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-4">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Risk profile</div>
<div class="space-y-3">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted">
<span>Pricing volatility</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="hedgeRiskPricing">—</span>/100</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-1 h-2 rounded bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 rounded" id="hedgeRiskPricingBar" style="width: 0%; background: rgba(247, 118, 142, 0.88);"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted">
<span>Provider lock-in</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="hedgeRiskLockin">—</span>/100</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-1 h-2 rounded bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 rounded" id="hedgeRiskLockinBar" style="width: 0%; background: rgba(187, 154, 247, 0.82);"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted">
<span>Latency friction</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="hedgeRiskLatency">—</span>/100</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-1 h-2 rounded bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 rounded" id="hedgeRiskLatencyBar" style="width: 0%; background: rgba(122, 162, 247, 0.82);"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted">
<span>Frontier exposure</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="hedgeRiskFrontier">—</span>/100</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-1 h-2 rounded bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 rounded" id="hedgeRiskFrontierBar" style="width: 0%; background: rgba(42, 195, 222, 0.78);"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-4 border-t border-brand-border pt-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Recommendation</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong" id="hedgeRecommendation">—</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed" id="hedgeNote">—</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-04-limit-case-entropy" aria-label="The Limit Case: Entropy at Infinite Velocity" data-slide-index="3" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">The Limit Case: Entropy at Infinite Velocity</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i1-section-04-limit-case-entropy</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12 mb-8" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-04-limit-case-entropy" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(4)" data-infographic-source="infographic.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i1-section-04-limit-case-entropy</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-brand-border">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8">
<div class="md:w-1/2">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-4">The Limit Case: Entropy at Infinite Velocity</h2>
<p class="text-lg text-brand-muted mb-6 leading-relaxed">
                            When generation velocity rises without hard constraints, small errors compound into systemic risk.
                            Stewarded loops keep entropy bounded by forcing every attempt through deterministic Physics.
                        </p>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong">AI generation velocity</div>
<div class="text-sm text-brand-muted font-mono"><span id="limitVelocityValue">75</span>/100</div>
</div>
<input class="mt-3 w-full" id="limitVelocitySlider" max="100" min="1" type="range" value="75"/>
<div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Unguarded AI</div>
<div class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong mt-1"><span id="limitUnguardedValue">—</span></div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Entropy / risk index</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Stewarded loops</div>
<div class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong mt-1"><span id="limitStewardedValue">—</span></div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Entropy / risk index</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="md:w-1/2">
<div class="chart-container">
<canvas id="limitCaseChart"></canvas>
</div>
<p class="text-xs text-center text-brand-muted mt-2">
                            Hover for values. The dashed marker indicates the “limit case” region.
                        </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-05-recursion-compounds" aria-label="Recursion Compounds (The Project Tree)" data-slide-index="4" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">Recursion Compounds (The Project Tree)</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i1-section-05-recursion-compounds</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12 mb-8" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-05-recursion-compounds" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(5)" data-infographic-source="infographic.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i1-section-05-recursion-compounds</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-brand-border border-l-8 border-l-brand-accent">
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
<div class="lg:w-5/12">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-4">Recursion Compounds (The Project Tree)</h2>
<p class="text-lg text-brand-muted mb-6 leading-relaxed">
	                            A loop is not just a retry. It is recursion through a structured state.
	                            Each cycle revisits every folder and file, growing the system while tightening interfaces and constraints.
	                        </p>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4 space-y-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong">Iteration cycle</div>
<div class="text-sm text-brand-muted font-mono"><span id="fsCycleValue">0</span>/12</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<button class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface text-brand-strong text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-[rgba(122,162,247,0.16)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/60" id="fsPlayBtn" type="button">
	                                    Play
	                                </button>
<input aria-label="Project recursion cycle slider" class="w-full" id="fsCycleSlider" max="12" min="0" step="1" type="range" value="0"/>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Folders</div>
<div class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong mt-1"><span id="fsFoldersCount">—</span></div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Files</div>
<div class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong mt-1"><span id="fsFilesCount">—</span></div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Touches / cycle</div>
<div class="text-lg font-bold text-brand-strong mt-1"><span id="fsTouchesCount">—</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
	                                Recursion pass: read → test → refactor → extend. The loop walks the whole tree, not just a single file.
	                            </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:w-7/12 grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-12 gap-4">
<div class="xl:col-span-7 border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4 bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)]" id="fsTreeCard">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Project filesystem (cycle <span id="fsCycleInline">0</span>)</div>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted"><span id="fsStageLabel">Seed</span></div>
</div>
<pre class="text-[11px] md:text-xs leading-5 text-brand-strong whitespace-pre overflow-auto max-h-80 font-mono" id="fsTree"></pre>
</div>
<div class="xl:col-span-5 border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4 bg-brand-light flex flex-col">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Side view: the loop grows a tree</div>
<div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="w-full max-w-[260px] h-64" id="fsGrowthSvg" viewbox="0 0 220 240">
<defs>
<lineargradient id="fsTrunk" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="rgba(242,243,248,0.75)"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="rgba(181,182,191,0.35)"></stop>
</lineargradient>
<lineargradient id="fsBark" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="rgba(242,243,248,0.55)"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="rgba(97,103,129,0.55)"></stop>
</lineargradient>
<radialgradient cx="50%" cy="40%" id="fsCanopy" r="70%">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="rgba(42,195,222,0.55)"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="rgba(122,162,247,0.20)"></stop>
</radialgradient>
</defs>
<!-- ground -->
<path d="M20 214 C 70 204, 150 204, 200 214" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.10)" stroke-width="2"></path>
<g id="fsTreeSeed" style="opacity: 1;">
<circle cx="110" cy="206" fill="rgba(187,154,247,0.55)" r="8"></circle>
<circle cx="110" cy="206" fill="rgba(242,243,248,0.75)" r="4"></circle>
</g>
<g id="fsTreeSapling" style="opacity: 0;">
<path d="M110 206 L110 160" stroke="url(#fsTrunk)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="5"></path>
<path d="M110 176 C 98 172, 90 164, 86 154" fill="none" stroke="rgba(42,195,222,0.60)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="4"></path>
<path d="M110 170 C 122 166, 132 158, 140 148" fill="none" stroke="rgba(122,162,247,0.55)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="4"></path>
<circle cx="86" cy="154" fill="rgba(42,195,222,0.22)" r="10"></circle>
<circle cx="140" cy="148" fill="rgba(122,162,247,0.20)" r="11"></circle>
</g>
<g id="fsTreeTree" style="opacity: 0;">
<path d="M110 150 C 78 144, 60 126, 52 104" fill="none" stroke="rgba(187,154,247,0.45)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="7"></path>
<path d="M110 142 C 142 136, 162 118, 174 96" fill="none" stroke="rgba(42,195,222,0.50)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="7"></path>
<circle cx="110" cy="92" fill="url(#fsCanopy)" r="46"></circle>
<circle cx="78" cy="102" fill="rgba(187,154,247,0.18)" r="26"></circle>
<circle cx="144" cy="104" fill="rgba(42,195,222,0.16)" r="28"></circle>
<circle cx="110" cy="92" fill="none" r="46" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.12)" stroke-width="2"></circle>
<!-- trunk + roots (anchor the canopy so it doesn't read as a floating orb) -->
<path d="M102 214 L118 214 L114 138 L106 138 Z" fill="url(#fsBark)" stroke="rgba(242,243,248,0.22)" stroke-width="1"></path>
<path d="M108 214 L112 214 L111 146 L109 146 Z" fill="rgba(242,243,248,0.14)"></path>
<path d="M110 214 C 98 214, 90 210, 84 204" fill="none" stroke="rgba(242,243,248,0.12)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="3"></path>
<path d="M110 214 C 122 214, 130 210, 136 204" fill="none" stroke="rgba(242,243,248,0.12)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="3"></path>
</g>
</svg>
</div>
<div class="mt-3 text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
<div class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong" id="fsGrowthStage">Seed</div>
<div id="fsGrowthCaption">A few files. One executable path. Minimal structure.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-06-value-migration" aria-label="The Value Migration" data-slide-index="5" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">The Value Migration</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i1-section-06-value-migration</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-6" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-06-value-migration" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(6)" data-infographic-source="infographic.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i1-section-06-value-migration</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 h-full flex flex-col border border-brand-border">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">The Value Migration</h2>
<p class="text-brand-muted mb-4 flex-grow">
	                    As execution becomes instant, value migrates up the stack. 
	                    <br/><br/>
	                    We are no longer bricklayers; we are the architects designing the blueprints. The "Work" is now defining the shape of the outcome, not producing it.
                </p>
<div class="chart-container" style="height: 300px;">
<canvas id="valueShiftChart"></canvas>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-07-steward-loop" aria-label="Anatomy of a Steward Loop" data-slide-index="6" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">Anatomy of a Steward Loop</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i1-section-07-steward-loop</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-6" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-07-steward-loop" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(7)" data-infographic-source="infographic.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i1-section-07-steward-loop</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 h-full flex flex-col border border-brand-border">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">Anatomy of a Steward Loop</h2>
<p class="text-brand-muted mb-6">
	                    In the limit case, we steward persistent loops. The loop traverses the terrain we define.
	                </p>
<!-- CSS Flow Chart -->
<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-4 w-full flex-grow py-4 bg-brand-light rounded-lg border border-brand-border">
<!-- Step 1: Human Intent -->
<div class="flow-node w-3/4 p-4 bg-brand-dark text-white rounded-lg shadow-md text-center border-l-4 border-brand-vibrant relative">
<div class="font-bold text-lg">1. The Architect</div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Shapes the Terrain (Intent &amp; Constraints)</div>
<!-- Arrow Down -->
<div class="absolute -bottom-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-l-[8px] border-l-transparent border-r-[8px] border-r-transparent border-t-[8px] border-t-brand-dark"></div>
</div>
<!-- Spacer -->
<div class="h-4"></div>
<!-- Step 2: The Engine -->
<div class="flow-node w-3/4 p-4 bg-brand-surface border-2 border-brand-primary text-brand-strong rounded-lg shadow-sm text-center relative">
<div class="font-bold text-lg">2. The Loop</div>
<div class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Traverses to Local Optima</div>
<!-- Loop Indicators -->
<div class="absolute top-1/2 -right-3 w-6 h-6 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-brand-primary rounded-full animate-spin"></div>
<!-- Arrow Down -->
<div class="absolute -bottom-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-l-[8px] border-l-transparent border-r-[8px] border-r-transparent border-t-[8px] border-t-brand-primary"></div>
</div>
<!-- Spacer -->
<div class="h-4"></div>
<!-- Step 3: The Steward -->
<div class="flow-node w-3/4 p-4 bg-brand-accent text-white rounded-lg shadow-md text-center relative">
<div class="font-bold text-lg">3. The Optima Check</div>
<div class="text-xs text-white/90 mt-1">Is this the right peak? Reshape if no.</div>
<!-- Arrow Up (Loop back) -->
<div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-8 text-brand-muted text-xs font-mono transform -rotate-90">Reshape Terrain</div>
<div class="absolute top-0 bottom-0 -left-4 w-4 border-l-2 border-dashed border-brand-border rounded-l-xl"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-08-optimization-terrain" aria-label="Shaping the Optimization Terrain" data-slide-index="7" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">Shaping the Optimization Terrain</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i1-section-08-optimization-terrain</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12 mt-8 mb-8" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-08-optimization-terrain" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(8)" data-infographic-source="infographic.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i1-section-08-optimization-terrain</span>
<div class="bg-brand-dark rounded-xl shadow-2xl p-8 text-white overflow-hidden relative">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Shaping the Optimization Terrain</h2>
<p class="text-brand-muted mb-6 max-w-3xl text-lg">
	                    This is the new game. You do not push the boulder up the hill. You <strong>reshape the hill</strong> so the boulder falls into the hole you want.
	                    <br/><br/>
<span class="text-brand-vibrant">Intent = Gravity.</span> Changing your intent warps the geometry of the solution space. 
                    The "Loop" simply calculates the shortest path to the mathematical optima you have defined. Who defines the sharpest peaks wins.
                </p>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
<div class="text-sm text-brand-muted">
                        Intent preset:
                        <span class="text-brand-strong font-semibold" id="terrainPresetLabel">Central Optima</span>
</div>
<button aria-controls="terrainPlot" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-2 rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-light text-brand-strong font-semibold hover:bg-[rgba(122,162,247,0.16)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-primary/60" id="terrainReshapeButton" type="button">
                        Reshape Terrain
                    </button>
</div>
<!-- Plotly Container -->
<div class="plotly-container mx-auto bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.70)] rounded-lg shadow-inner border border-brand-border" id="terrainPlot"></div>
<div class="text-center mt-2 text-sm text-brand-muted">
                    Interactive 3D Terrain: The "Peaks" are the Optima (High Value Outcomes). The "Valleys" are Failure States.
                </div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i1-section-09-hierarchy-of-stewardship" aria-label="The Hierarchy of Stewardship" data-slide-index="8" role="group">
