            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-00-state-run-new-state" aria-label="State → Run P( ) → New State" data-slide-index="9" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">State → Run P( ) → New State</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i2-section-00-state-run-new-state</span>
              </div>
              <div class="max-w-[1500px] mx-auto px-6 py-16 relative z-10" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-00-state-run-new-state" data-infographic-selector="header &gt; div:nth-of-type(3)" data-infographic-source="infographic-2.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i2-section-00-state-run-new-state</span>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
<div>
<h4 class="text-cyber-accent font-mono text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Software Development as Code (SDaC)</h4>
<h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tight">
                        The Shape of <br/>
<span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyber-primary via-cyber-neon to-cyber-accent">All Work</span>
</h1>
<p class="text-xl text-cyber-muted max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
                        Every productive process follows the same recursive shape. The "Product" isn't the code.
                        <strong class="text-white">The Loop is the Product.</strong>
</p>
</div>
<div class="bg-cyber-panel border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-2xl relative">
<div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-xs font-mono text-gray-500">INTERACTIVE MODEL</div>
<div class="text-center font-mono text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-8 text-cyber-success">
                        P(Z<span class="text-sm align-sub">n</span>) = Z<span class="text-sm align-sub">n+1</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center text-center">
<div class="loop-node w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-cyber-muted flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-gray-900" id="state-prev">
<span class="text-gray-400 font-mono text-xs mb-1">STATE</span>
<span class="text-2xl font-bold">Z<span class="text-sm">n</span></span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center mx-4">
<div class="arrow-right mb-2"></div>
<button class="bg-cyber-primary hover:bg-cyber-neon text-white font-bold py-2 px-6 rounded shadow-lg transition-all transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 animate-glow" id="run-loop-btn">
                                RUN P( )
                            </button>
<div class="text-xs text-cyber-accent mt-2 font-mono">Process Iteration</div>
</div>
<div class="loop-node w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-cyber-success flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-gray-900 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.3)]" id="state-next">
<span class="text-gray-400 font-mono text-xs mb-1">NEW STATE</span>
<span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Z<span class="text-sm">n+1</span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 font-mono text-xs text-center text-cyber-muted h-6" id="loop-log">
                        Click 'RUN P()' to iterate the system state.
                    </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-01-fractal-nature" aria-label="The Fractal Nature" data-slide-index="10" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">The Fractal Nature</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i2-section-01-fractal-nature</span>
              </div>
              <section class="bg-gray-900/50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-800" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-01-fractal-nature" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(1)" data-infographic-source="infographic-2.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i2-section-01-fractal-nature</span>
  <style>
    [data-role="fractal-sim"] .scale-button {
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      color: #cbd5f5;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
    }
    [data-role="fractal-sim"] .scale-button.is-active {
      border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.7);
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.18);
      color: #fff;
    }
    [data-role="fractal-sim"] .fractal-layer.is-active {
      border-color: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.8) !important;
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08);
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }
  </style>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">The Fractal Nature of Work</h2>
    <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-cyber-accent mb-6"></div>
    <p class="text-cyber-muted mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Same loop, different cadence. Historically, a function evolved in minutes; a company evolved in years.
      AI compresses the lower-loop cadences first, but organizational loops still move slower.
      Each level’s state is the accumulated output of the faster loops beneath it.
    </p>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-400 list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
      <li>Bottom-layer drift multiplies upward.</li>
      <li>Bottom-layer improvements compound upward.</li>
      <li>Intent and validation at every scale keep the loop coherent.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="mt-6 bg-gray-800/50 p-4 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-cyber-neon">
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-cyber-neon">
        Z<sub>n+1</sub> = P<sub>k</sub>(Z<sub>n</sub>)<br/>
        P<sub>k+1</sub> = improve(P<sub>k</sub>, evidence)
      </p>
    </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="bg-cyber-panel p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-700 shadow-xl" data-role="fractal-sim">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-500 uppercase">Scale lens</span>
        <button class="scale-button is-active" data-role="scale-button" data-scale="company" type="button">Company</button>
        <button class="scale-button" data-role="scale-button" data-scale="product" type="button">Product</button>
        <button class="scale-button" data-role="scale-button" data-scale="feature" type="button">Feature</button>
        <button class="scale-button" data-role="scale-button" data-scale="function" type="button">Function</button>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="fractal-layer border-l-cyber-primary is-active" data-role="scale-card" data-scale="company" data-state="Market position" data-process="Culture + leadership" data-cadence="Years" data-example="Strategic bets">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-lg text-cyber-primary">Company Scale</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs bg-gray-800 px-2 py-1 rounded text-gray-300">~Years</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">State: Market position · Process: Culture + leadership</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fractal-layer border-l-cyber-neon ml-4" data-role="scale-card" data-scale="product" data-state="System architecture" data-process="Org + strategy" data-cadence="Months" data-example="Portfolio bets">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-md text-cyber-neon">Product Scale</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs bg-gray-800 px-2 py-1 rounded text-gray-300">~Months</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">State: System architecture · Process: Org + strategy</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fractal-layer border-l-cyber-accent ml-8" data-role="scale-card" data-scale="feature" data-state="Capabilities" data-process="Team practices" data-cadence="Days" data-example="Release scope">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-sm text-cyber-accent">Feature Scale</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs bg-gray-800 px-2 py-1 rounded text-gray-300">~Days</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">State: Capabilities · Process: Team practices</div>
        </div>
        <div class="fractal-layer border-l-cyber-success ml-12" data-role="scale-card" data-scale="function" data-state="Implementation" data-process="Dev tools" data-cadence="Minutes" data-example="Code edits">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
            <span class="font-bold text-xs text-cyber-success">Function Scale</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-[10px] bg-gray-800 px-2 py-1 rounded text-gray-300">~Minutes</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">State: Implementation · Process: Dev tools</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-4 bg-gray-900/70 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-700">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-gray-500">Selected scale</div>
        <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">State</div>
            <div class="text-white font-semibold" data-role="fractal-state">Market position</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Process</div>
            <div class="text-white font-semibold" data-role="fractal-process">Culture + leadership</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Cadence</div>
            <div class="text-white font-semibold" data-role="fractal-cadence">Years</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">Example</div>
            <div class="text-white font-semibold" data-role="fractal-example">Strategic bets</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 text-xs text-gray-500" data-role="fractal-insight">
          Improve the fastest loops first; the rest of the stack inherits the gain.
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
  (function () {
    const script = document.currentScript;
    const root = script ? script.closest('[data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-01-fractal-nature"]') : null;
    if (!root || root.dataset.fractalReady === "1") return;
    root.dataset.fractalReady = "1";

    const buttons = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll('[data-role="scale-button"]'));
    const cards = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll('[data-role="scale-card"]'));
    const stateEl = root.querySelector('[data-role="fractal-state"]');
    const processEl = root.querySelector('[data-role="fractal-process"]');
    const cadenceEl = root.querySelector('[data-role="fractal-cadence"]');
    const exampleEl = root.querySelector('[data-role="fractal-example"]');
    const insightEl = root.querySelector('[data-role="fractal-insight"]');

    if (!buttons.length || !cards.length || !stateEl || !processEl || !cadenceEl || !exampleEl || !insightEl) return;

    const selectScale = (scale) => {
      cards.forEach((card) => {
        const active = card.dataset.scale === scale;
        card.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
      });
      buttons.forEach((btn) => {
        const active = btn.dataset.scale === scale;
        btn.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
        btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', active ? 'true' : 'false');
      });

      const selected = cards.find((card) => card.dataset.scale === scale) || cards[0];
      stateEl.textContent = selected.dataset.state || '—';
      processEl.textContent = selected.dataset.process || '—';
      cadenceEl.textContent = selected.dataset.cadence || '—';
      exampleEl.textContent = selected.dataset.example || '—';
      insightEl.textContent = `At ${selected.dataset.cadence || 'this cadence'}, the loop state is "${selected.dataset.state || 'state'}" and the process is "${selected.dataset.process || 'process'}".`;
    };

    buttons.forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => selectScale(btn.dataset.scale || 'company'));
    });
    cards.forEach((card) => {
      card.addEventListener('click', () => selectScale(card.dataset.scale || 'company'));
    });

    selectScale('company');
  })();
  </script>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-02-clock-speed" aria-label="AI Changes the Clock Speed" data-slide-index="11" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">AI Changes the Clock Speed</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i2-section-02-clock-speed</span>
              </div>
              <section data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-02-clock-speed" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(2)" data-infographic-source="infographic-2.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i2-section-02-clock-speed</span>
<div class="text-center mb-12">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">AI Changes the Clock Speed</h2>
<p class="text-cyber-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                    The iteration that took a day now takes minutes. This is pure acceleration.
                </p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-center">
<div class="chart-container">
<canvas id="clockSpeedChart"></canvas>
</div>
<div class="bg-cyber-panel p-8 rounded-xl border border-gray-700">
<h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-cyber-accent mb-4">From "Sprint" to "Loop"</h3>
<ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-300 text-sm">
<li class="flex items-start">
<span class="text-cyber-neon mr-2">➜</span>
<div>
<strong class="text-white">Feature Dev:</strong> Reduced from weeks to days. The constraint is no longer typing speed, but verification speed.
                            </div>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start">
<span class="text-cyber-neon mr-2">➜</span>
<div>
<strong class="text-white">Refactoring:</strong> Reduced from days to minutes. Entire codebases can be fluidly reshaped.
                            </div>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start">
<span class="text-cyber-neon mr-2">➜</span>
<div>
<strong class="text-white">The Danger:</strong> A faster loop that drifts is just faster drift. Speed amplifies whatever is already there.
                            </div>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-03-drift-vs-convergence" aria-label="Drift vs. Convergence" data-slide-index="12" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">Drift vs. Convergence</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i2-section-03-drift-vs-convergence</span>
              </div>
              <section class="bg-gray-900/50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-800" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-03-drift-vs-convergence" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(3)" data-infographic-source="infographic-2.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i2-section-03-drift-vs-convergence</span>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
<div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col justify-center">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Drift vs. Convergence</h2>
<div class="h-1 w-20 bg-cyber-danger mb-6"></div>
<p class="text-cyber-muted mb-6">
                        Acceleration without structure is chaos.
                        <br/><br/>
<strong>Red Band:</strong> Vibe coding. It starts fast, but variance expands and rework dominates as the foundations crack.
                        <br/><br/>
<strong>Green Band:</strong> SDaC. It starts slower while tooling is built, then compounds into higher throughput with tighter variance.
                    </p>
<div class="p-4 bg-cyber-panel rounded border border-gray-700 space-y-4">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
<label class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500" for="drift-week-slider">Timeline</label>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<button class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1.5 rounded border border-gray-600 text-gray-200 hover:text-white hover:border-gray-400 transition-colors" id="drift-play-btn">
                                    Play
                                </button>
<span class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-300" id="drift-week-value">8 / 26</span>
</div>
</div>
<input class="w-full accent-cyber-success" id="drift-week-slider" max="26" min="1" type="range" value="8"/>
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
                            Early: Vibe coding wins on speed. By week 8 SDaC overtakes. After that, vibe collapses under rising foundation debt.
                        </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
<div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-800/50 p-3 border border-gray-700">
<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-cyber-danger mb-2">Vibe Coding</div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400">
<span id="vibe-output-label">Net Output</span>
<span class="font-mono text-gray-200" id="vibe-output">-</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400">
<span>Variance</span>
<span class="font-mono text-gray-200" id="vibe-variance">-</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400">
<span>Foundation Debt</span>
<span class="font-mono text-gray-200" id="vibe-debt">-</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-2 h-2 bg-gray-700 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 bg-cyber-danger transition-all duration-300" id="vibe-debt-bar" style="width: 0%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-800/50 p-3 border border-gray-700">
<div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-cyber-success mb-2">SDaC</div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400">
<span id="sdac-output-label">Net Output</span>
<span class="font-mono text-gray-200" id="sdac-output">-</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400">
<span>Variance</span>
<span class="font-mono text-gray-200" id="sdac-variance">-</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400">
<span>Tooling Maturity</span>
<span class="font-mono text-gray-200" id="sdac-maturity">-</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-2 h-2 bg-gray-700 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 bg-cyber-success transition-all duration-300" id="sdac-maturity-bar" style="width: 0%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-500">
<span>Velocity (iterations / time)</span>
<span class="font-mono text-gray-300" id="drift-velocity-readout">-</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-1">
<span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500">View</span>
<div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-gray-700 bg-gray-900/40 p-1 text-xs font-mono">
<button class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md bg-cyber-success/20 text-white border border-cyber-success/40" id="drift-view-weekly">
                                    Weekly
                                </button>
<button class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-gray-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors" id="drift-view-cumulative">
                                    Cumulative
                                </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-4 bg-cyber-panel rounded border border-gray-700">
<strong class="text-white block mb-2">The SDaC Bundle:</strong>
<ul class="text-xs text-gray-400 list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
<li>Explicit Intent Surfaces</li>
<li>Bounded Effectors</li>
<li>Deterministic Validators</li>
<li>Loops that Converge</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-8">
<div class="chart-container">
<canvas id="driftChart"></canvas>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-04-moat-also-loop" aria-label="The Moat Is Also the Loop" data-slide-index="13" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">The Moat Is Also the Loop</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i2-section-04-moat-also-loop</span>
              </div>
              <section class="bg-cyber-panel rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-700" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-04-moat-also-loop" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(4)" data-infographic-source="infographic-2.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i2-section-04-moat-also-loop</span>
<div class="text-center mb-8 space-y-4">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-white">The Moat Is Also the Loop</h2>
<p class="text-cyber-muted w-full leading-relaxed">
                    Iteration can improve the state and improve the process that creates it.
                </p>
<div class="w-full grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm font-mono">
<div class="rounded-lg border border-cyber-success/30 bg-cyber-success/10 px-4 py-2 text-cyber-success">
                        State: Z<sub>n+1</sub> = P<sub>k</sub>(Z<sub>n</sub>)
                    </div>
<div class="rounded-lg border border-cyber-accent/30 bg-cyber-accent/10 px-4 py-2 text-cyber-accent">
                        Process: P<sub>k+1</sub> = improve(P<sub>k</sub>, Z<sub>n</sub>)
                    </div>
</div>
<p class="text-cyber-muted w-full leading-relaxed">
                    That self-upgrading loop is the moat: it upgrades itself, sets the clock speed of your business, and becomes an immune system against ever-evolving competition.
                </p>
</div>
<div class="bg-cyber-dark border border-gray-700 rounded-xl p-8">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
<div>
<div class="text-center font-mono mb-8">
<div class="text-2xl md:text-3xl text-cyber-success">
	                                Z<sub>n+1</sub> = P<sub>k</sub>(Z<sub>n</sub>)
	                            </div>
<div class="text-lg md:text-2xl text-cyber-accent mt-2">
	                                P<sub>k+1</sub> = improve(P<sub>k</sub>, Z<sub>n</sub>)
	                            </div>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center text-center mb-6">
<div class="loop-node w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-cyber-muted flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-gray-900" id="state-prev-process">
<span class="text-gray-400 font-mono text-xs mb-1">STATE</span>
<span class="text-2xl font-bold">Z<sub>n</sub></span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center mx-4">
<div class="arrow-right mb-2"></div>
<button class="bg-cyber-neon hover:bg-cyber-primary text-white font-bold py-2 px-6 rounded shadow-lg transition-all transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95" id="run-process-btn">
                                    RUN P_k( )
                                </button>
<div class="text-xs text-cyber-accent mt-2 font-mono">Process Iteration</div>
</div>
<div class="loop-node w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-cyber-success flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-gray-900 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(16,185,129,0.3)]" id="state-next-process">
<span class="text-gray-400 font-mono text-xs mb-1">NEW STATE</span>
<span class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Z<sub>n+1</sub></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="font-mono text-xs text-center text-cyber-muted h-6" id="loop-log-process">
	                            Click 'RUN P_k( )' to advance the state; evidence upgrades the process right after.
	                        </div>
</div>
<div class="bg-gray-800/60 rounded-lg border border-gray-700 p-6">
<h3 class="text-sm font-mono text-gray-400 mb-4 uppercase">Process Improvement Path</h3>
<div class="space-y-4">
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 items-center gap-4">
<div class="text-center" id="process-prev">
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2">Current Process</p>
<div class="loop-node w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-cyber-neon bg-gray-900 flex flex-col items-center justify-center mx-auto" id="process-prev-value">
<p class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-cyber-neon">P<sub>k</sub></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="arrow-right"></div>
<div class="text-center" id="process-next">
<p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-2">Improved Process</p>
<div class="loop-node w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-cyber-accent bg-gray-900 flex flex-col items-center justify-center mx-auto" id="process-next-value">
<p class="font-mono text-2xl font-bold text-cyber-accent">P<sub>k+1</sub></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="font-mono text-sm text-gray-300">
                                    P<sub>k+1</sub> = improve(P<sub>k</sub>, Z<sub>n</sub>)
                                </div>
<div>
<label class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500" for="evidence-slider">Evidence Strength</label>
<div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-3">
<input class="w-full accent-cyber-neon" id="evidence-slider" max="5" min="1" type="range" value="2"/>
<span class="font-mono text-xs text-cyber-accent w-8 text-right" id="evidence-value">2</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-3">
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400 mb-1">
<span>Velocity</span>
<span id="velocity-value">50%</span>
</div>
<div class="h-2 bg-gray-700 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 bg-cyber-neon rounded-full transition-all duration-300" id="velocity-bar" style="width: 50%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400 mb-1">
<span>Reliability</span>
<span id="reliability-value">50%</span>
</div>
<div class="h-2 bg-gray-700 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 bg-cyber-accent rounded-full transition-all duration-300" id="reliability-bar" style="width: 50%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="flex justify-between text-xs text-gray-400 mb-1">
<span>Defensibility</span>
<span id="defensibility-value">50%</span>
</div>
<div class="h-2 bg-gray-700 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 bg-cyber-success rounded-full transition-all duration-300" id="defensibility-bar" style="width: 50%;"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="text-xs text-cyber-muted" id="process-note">
                                    Better process means the next loop compounds. Same recurrence, stronger operator, stronger moat.
                                </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-05-loop-is-the-moat" aria-label="The Loop is the Moat" data-slide-index="14" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">The Loop is the Moat</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i2-section-05-loop-is-the-moat</span>
              </div>
              <section class="text-center py-12" data-infographic-section-id="i2-section-05-loop-is-the-moat" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(5)" data-infographic-source="infographic-2.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i2-section-05-loop-is-the-moat</span>
<div class="moat-loop inline-block p-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyber-primary via-cyber-neon to-cyber-accent rounded-2xl">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="moat-loop-svg" preserveaspectratio="none" viewbox="0 0 100 100">
<rect class="moat-loop-track" height="96" rx="16" width="96" x="2" y="2"></rect>
<rect class="moat-loop-runner" height="96" pathlength="100" rx="16" width="96" x="2" y="2"></rect>
</svg>
<div class="bg-cyber-dark rounded-xl p-10 md:p-16">
<h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6">The Loop is the Moat</h2>
<p class="text-xl text-cyber-muted max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
	                        Intent becomes operational when formalized into Maps and executed by loops:
	                        <span class="block font-mono text-cyber-success mt-3">intent -&gt; map -&gt; loop -&gt; terrain</span>
<span class="block font-mono text-cyber-accent mt-1">terrain -&gt; map(sync) -&gt; next loop</span>
<span class="block mt-3 text-base md:text-lg">
	                            If the loop is validated, a useful compact form is:
	                        </span>
<span class="block font-mono text-cyber-success mt-3">Z<sub>n+1</sub> = P<sub>k</sub>(Z<sub>n</sub>)</span>
<span class="block font-mono text-cyber-accent mt-1">P<sub>k+1</sub> = improve(P<sub>k</sub>, Z<sub>n</sub>)</span>
<span class="block mt-3 text-base md:text-lg">
	                            Compounding only holds under ratchets:
	                            <span class="font-mono text-cyber-vibrant">q<sub>now</sub> &gt;= q<sub>prev</sub></span>.
	                        </span>
<span class="block mt-4">
	                            This is how AI execution becomes reliable: bounded loops convert intent to verified state and feed reality back into tomorrow’s maps.
	                        </span>
</p>
<button class="text-cyber-accent hover:text-white underline decoration-cyber-neon decoration-2 underline-offset-4 transition-colors" onclick="window.scrollTo({top: 0, behavior: 'smooth'})">
	                        Restart the Loop
	                    </button>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i3-section-01-substrate" aria-label="The Substrate (Map · Terrain · Ledger)" data-slide-index="15" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">The Substrate (Map · Terrain · Ledger)</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i3-section-01-substrate</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12" data-infographic-section-id="i3-section-01-substrate" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(1)" data-infographic-source="infographic-3.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i3-section-01-substrate</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-brand-border border-l-8 border-l-brand-primary">
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 substrate-main-layout">
<div class="lg:w-5/12 substrate-main-copy">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">The Substrate (Map · Terrain · Ledger)</h2>
<p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                            SDaC is practical when the system has three explicit surfaces:
                            <span class="text-brand-strong font-semibold">intent</span>,
                            <span class="text-brand-strong font-semibold">runnable reality</span>,
                            and a deterministic <span class="text-brand-strong font-semibold">evidence trail</span>.
                        </p>
<div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3">
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">MAP</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong">Intent surface</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">Mission objects, constraints, and acceptance criteria.</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">TERRAIN</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong">Runnable reality</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">Code, configs, schemas, and policies your system actually runs.</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">LEDGER</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-strong">Evidence trail</div>
<div class="mt-1 text-xs text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">Append-only records of diffs, validator output, and decisions.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:w-7/12 substrate-main-workspace">
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-3">
<div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)] p-1 text-sm">
<button aria-pressed="true" class="pill-tab font-mono" data-substrate-tab="map" type="button">Map</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="pill-tab font-mono" data-substrate-tab="terrain" type="button">Terrain</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="pill-tab font-mono" data-substrate-tab="ledger" type="button">Ledger</button>
</div>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="soft-toggle font-mono" id="substrateTraceToggle" type="button">Trace: Off</button>
</div>
<div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 substrate-dual-panel">
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3 bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)]">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Example project tree</div>
<pre class="text-[11px] md:text-xs leading-5 text-brand-strong whitespace-pre overflow-auto max-h-80 font-mono" id="substrateTree"></pre>
</div>
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3 bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)]">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">File</div>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted" id="substrateFileLabel">—</div>
</div>
<pre class="text-[11px] md:text-xs leading-5 text-brand-strong whitespace-pre overflow-auto max-h-80 font-mono" id="substrateFile"></pre>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs text-brand-muted">
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono"><span class="trace-swatch read"></span>read</span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono"><span class="trace-swatch write"></span>write</span>
<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono"><span class="trace-swatch exec"></span>execute</span>
<span class="text-xs text-brand-muted">Toggle trace to see which artifacts the loop touches.</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i3-section-02-mission-objects" aria-label="Mission Objects (Intent As Code)" data-slide-index="16" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">Mission Objects (Intent As Code)</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i3-section-02-mission-objects</span>
              </div>
              <section class="col-span-1 md:col-span-12" data-infographic-section-id="i3-section-02-mission-objects" data-infographic-selector="main &gt; section:nth-of-type(2)" data-infographic-source="infographic-3.html" data-infographic-status="published" data-infographic-fragment-shell="1">
<span data-infographic-fragment-label="1" aria-hidden="true">i3-section-02-mission-objects</span>
<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-brand-border border-l-8 border-l-brand-accent">
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
<div class="lg:w-5/12">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">Mission Objects (Intent As Code)</h2>
<p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                            A mission object is a programmable unit of work: goals, constraints, budgets, and acceptance criteria.
                            It turns a vague request into a deterministic interface.
                        </p>
<div class="mt-5 bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Why it matters</div>
<div class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                                The tighter the mission boundary, the smaller the search space.
                                That is how you get faster convergence without “trusting the model.”
                            </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:w-7/12">
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="space-y-3">
<div class="inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1 rounded-lg border border-brand-border bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)] p-1 text-sm">
<button aria-pressed="true" class="pill-tab font-mono" data-mission-preset="bugfix" type="button">Bugfix</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="pill-tab font-mono" data-mission-preset="feature" type="button">Feature</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="pill-tab font-mono" data-mission-preset="refactor" type="button">Refactor</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="pill-tab font-mono" data-mission-preset="compliance" type="button">Compliance</button>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">
<span>Constraint tightness</span>
<span class="text-brand-strong" id="missionTightnessValue">55%</span>
</div>
</div>
<label class="sr-only" for="missionTightnessSlider">Constraint tightness slider</label>
<input class="mt-3 w-full" id="missionTightnessSlider" max="100" min="0" type="range" value="55"/>
<div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-12 gap-4">
<div class="xl:col-span-7 border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3 bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)]">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">mission.yaml</div>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted" id="missionIdLabel">—</div>
</div>
<pre class="text-[11px] md:text-xs leading-5 text-brand-strong whitespace-pre overflow-auto max-h-80 font-mono" id="missionYaml"></pre>
<div class="mt-3 border border-brand-border rounded-lg bg-brand-light p-3">
<div class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-muted">Constraint → Deterministic Gate</div>
<div class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-[11px] leading-5 font-mono text-brand-muted" id="missionGateMap"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="xl:col-span-5 space-y-3">
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Derived interface</div>
<div class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Expected retries</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="missionRetries">—</span>x</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Convergence rate</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="missionConvergence">—</span>/100</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Drift risk</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="missionDrift">—</span>/100</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Budgets (bounded exits)</div>
<div class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Max calls</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="missionMaxCalls">—</span></span>
</div>
<div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Max latency</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="missionMaxLatency">—</span></span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3 text-xs text-brand-muted">If the budget is exceeded, the loop exits with a deterministic failure you can reason about.</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Mission State of Record</div>
<div class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Status</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong" id="missionLifecycleStatus">—</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Attempt</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong" id="missionAttemptLabel">—</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Last run</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong" id="missionLastRun">—</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3 text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted break-all" id="missionEvidencePath">—</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Trade-off</div>
<div class="mt-2">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted">
<span>Flexibility</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="missionFlex">—</span>%</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-1 h-2 rounded bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 rounded" id="missionFlexBar" style="width: 0%; background: rgba(42, 195, 222, 0.78);"></div>
</div>
<div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted">
<span>Constraint strength</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="missionTight">—</span>%</span>
</div>
<div class="mt-1 h-2 rounded bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.08)] overflow-hidden">
<div class="h-2 rounded" id="missionTightBar" style="width: 0%; background: rgba(187, 154, 247, 0.82);"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Validation Pipeline</div>
<div class="mt-2 text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span>Schema compile</span>
