<div class="bg-brand-surface rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 border border-brand-border border-l-8 border-l-brand-danger">
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
<div class="lg:w-5/12">
<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-strong mb-3">Validator Bundles (Define Good + Budgets)</h2>
<p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                            Validators are “physics.” Budgets are “governors.” Together they turn open-ended iteration into a bounded system.
                            The loop can fail, but it fails deterministically.
                        </p>
<div class="mt-5 bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Interactive model</div>
<div class="text-sm text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                                Toggle validators and adjust the retry budget. Run the bundle and watch what becomes provable.
                            </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:w-7/12">
<div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-4">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-12 gap-4">
<div class="xl:col-span-5 space-y-3">
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Validator bundle</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
<button aria-pressed="true" class="soft-toggle font-mono" data-validator="schema" type="button">Schema</button>
<button aria-pressed="true" class="soft-toggle font-mono" data-validator="tests" type="button">Unit tests</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="soft-toggle font-mono" data-validator="integration" type="button">Integration</button>
<button aria-pressed="true" class="soft-toggle font-mono" data-validator="security" type="button">Security</button>
<button aria-pressed="true" class="soft-toggle font-mono" data-validator="policy" type="button">Policy</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="soft-toggle font-mono" data-validator="style" type="button">Style</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-muted">
<span class="font-mono">Retry budget</span>
<span class="font-mono text-brand-strong"><span id="validatorBudgetValue">4</span> attempts</span>
</div>
<label class="sr-only" for="validatorBudgetSlider">Retry budget slider</label>
<input class="mt-2 w-full" id="validatorBudgetSlider" max="10" min="1" type="range" value="4"/>
<button aria-pressed="false" class="mt-3 soft-toggle w-full font-mono" id="validatorRunBtn" type="button">Run Validators</button>
</div>
<div class="bg-brand-surface border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Results</div>
<div class="space-y-2 text-xs text-brand-muted" id="validatorResults"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="xl:col-span-7 space-y-3">
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3 bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)]">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted mb-2">Sample diff (incoming patch)</div>
<pre class="text-[11px] md:text-xs leading-5 text-brand-strong whitespace-pre overflow-auto max-h-56 font-mono" id="validatorDiff"></pre>
</div>
<div class="border border-brand-border rounded-xl p-3 bg-[rgba(6,7,12,0.72)]">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted">Ledger entry (evidence)</div>
<div class="text-xs font-mono text-brand-muted" id="validatorRunId">run_000</div>
</div>
<pre class="text-[11px] md:text-xs leading-5 text-brand-strong whitespace-pre overflow-auto max-h-56 font-mono" id="validatorLedger"></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
