            </section><section class="infographic-slide" data-infographic-section-id="i3-section-08-ouroboros-protocol" aria-label="Ouroboros Protocol (Write → Judge → Refine)" data-slide-index="20" role="group">
              <div class="infographic-slide__header">
                <span class="infographic-slide__title">Ouroboros Protocol (Write → Judge → Refine)</span>
                <span class="infographic-slide__meta">i3-section-08-ouroboros-protocol</span>
